data: {"id": "f08cb85825db4c35-thinking-parallel_evidence-4233", "run_id": "f08cb85825db4c35", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n1.  **Pod 当前状态确认**\n    *   **Pod 状态**：`Pending`。\n    *   **容器状态**：`Waiting (ContainerCreating)`。\n    *   **节点调度**：已被调度至 `node2 (10.2.0.50)`。\n    *   **Metrics 印证**：`kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Pending)、`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (ContainerCreating)、重启次数为 0。Pod UID 为 `b134b5a8-7471-4feb-a975-9fbb0cc4f912`。\n\n2.  **异常根因证据 (Events & Describe)**\n    *   **事件 Reason**：`FailedCreatePodSandBox` 和 `NoNetworkFound`。\n    *   **具体报错**：`network-attachment-definition 'unavailable-ne", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788436031879, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "f08cb85825db4c35-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "f08cb85825db4c35", "seq": 4234, "ts_ms": 1788436039252, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 38.664, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/f08cb85825db4c35-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "3bf8bf69bf7125bfa210012269928aedc2b39d01ad240fdf766dcac846243f71", "bytes": 2634}, "snapshot_sha256": "4bb7a4915a42a5c1c27de8d77a9ce683f9c29b69219ac464ddd0ac49d84a4319"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

